body.zh-TW:
想確保 Claude 只在專案資料夾裡活動、不隨意碰外頭的檔案，這版把目錄邊界和捷徑的把關一起收緊了。

路徑檢查現在會拒絕部分 symlink（符號連結，指向另一個位置的捷徑檔），對「哪些路徑算在工作目錄內」的認定也更嚴格，部分路徑現在會跳出確認詢問。

若啟用阻止讀取工作目錄外檔案的設定（對應設定鍵如下）：

```json
{
  "permissions": {
    "blockReadsOutsideWorkingDirectories": true
  }
}
```

在略過權限與自動模式下，更多 Bash 指令會先問過你再執行，部分在自動模式還會直接被拒。若 Bash 指令點名的路徑正屬於 Read 或 Edit 的拒絕規則內，現在會直接擋下而不再詢問。⟦彷彿替自家菜園重新立好竹籬笆，連穿過圍籬的小水溝都一併封上，想伸手採隔壁畦的菜就得先問過主人。⟧

body.en:
To help make sure Claude stays inside the project folder and does not touch outside files unchecked, this release tightens the checks on both directory boundaries and shortcuts.

Path checks now refuse some symlinks (shortcut files pointing to another location), and the rules for what counts as inside a working directory are stricter, so some paths now prompt for confirmation.

If the setting that blocks reading files outside working directories is enabled (see the key below):

```json
{
  "permissions": {
    "blockReadsOutsideWorkingDirectories": true
  }
}
```

In bypass and auto modes, more Bash commands now ask you first before running, and some are denied outright in auto mode. If a Bash command names a path covered by a Read or Edit deny rule, it is now blocked directly instead of asking. ⟦Rebuilding a bamboo fence around your vegetable patch and sealing the drainage ditches underneath means anyone reaching for a neighbor's row has to ask the owner first.⟧

body.zh-TW:
對話剛結束，你馬上想接著下一個指令，不用再被額外檢查拖住節奏。現在每一輪結束不再等待驗證檢查，整個工作階段也能少花一些 token（AI 處理與計費的文字單位）在技能建議上。

若想重新開啟其中一項，可以到 `/plugins` 切換，或在 `settings.json` 加入對應設定：

```json
{
  "plugins": {
    "skill-reminder": {
      "enabled": true
    },
    "verify-reminder": {
      "enabled": true
    }
  }
}
```

⟦跟新手機用熟後關掉系統的新手導覽一樣，不再每按一步都跳提醒，真的想看隨時再打開就好。⟧

body.en:
Right after a conversation wraps up, you can jump straight to your next command without extra checks slowing your pace. Turns now end without waiting on the verify check, and sessions spend fewer tokens (the text units AI processes and bills by) on skill suggestions.

To turn either one back on, toggle it in `/plugins` or add the corresponding setting in `settings.json`:

```json
{
  "plugins": {
    "skill-reminder": {
      "enabled": true
    },
    "verify-reminder": {
      "enabled": true
    }
  }
}
```

⟦Like turning off the onboarding tips on a new phone once you know your way around, you no longer get a prompt on every tap, and you can always switch them back on if you need them.⟧

body.zh-TW:
工作階段現在佔用更少磁碟空間。自動審查不再把審查端自己的對話另外存成一份紀錄檔。

想回頭核對審查過程怎麼判斷時，可在 `settings.json` 加入這段設定把紀錄留著：

```json
{
  "approval_judge": {
    "child_session_log": "retained"
  }
}
```

⟦看牙醫拍完檢查影像，以前診所每次都把助理核對的草稿單一併印給你帶走，現在預設不印，想留存再開口請他附。⟧

body.en:
Sessions now take up less disk space. Auto-review no longer saves the reviewer's own conversation as a separate log file.

If you want to go back and check how the review made its judgment, you can keep the log by adding this setting to `settings.json`:

```json
{
  "approval_judge": {
    "child_session_log": "retained"
  }
}
```

⟦Think of getting dental X-rays: previously the clinic always printed the assistant's verification draft for you to take home, whereas now it skips printing by default unless you ask for a copy.⟧
